{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01665",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 9.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "okay, doctor, we're all set in here i'll give you the the numbers when you want them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.98,
      "end_seconds": 14.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.24,
      "end_seconds": 22.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a painful blistering rash on one side, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.8,
      "end_seconds": 28.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.52,
      "end_seconds": 31.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "About... well, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.24,
      "end_seconds": 36.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.31,
      "end_seconds": 53.74,
      "duration_seconds": 16.43,
      "text": "I'd say once or twice a day. I've also been feeling unwell. As for feeling unwell, moderate, really. And there's sensitivity to clothes touching as well, about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.34,
      "end_seconds": 57.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "And what about eye involvement or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.74,
      "end_seconds": 60.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "no, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.41,
      "end_seconds": 65.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "And what about rash across the midline or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.13,
      "end_seconds": 74.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "No rash across the midline or weakness, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.09,
      "end_seconds": 77.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.09,
      "end_seconds": 83.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "hmm, no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.66,
      "end_seconds": 89.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.2,
      "end_seconds": 94.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.11,
      "end_seconds": 99.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.88,
      "end_seconds": 103.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.42,
      "end_seconds": 108.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.54,
      "end_seconds": 115.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "I had my appendix taken out when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.41,
      "end_seconds": 121.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.13,
      "end_seconds": 125.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "yes, cat fur i get wheezing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.43,
      "end_seconds": 141.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Okay, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.26,
      "end_seconds": 143.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "I've got migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.52,
      "end_seconds": 154.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "Yes, migraines is known to us, good to have that clear. Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.87,
      "end_seconds": 165.26,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. I hardly move around during the day. I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.95,
      "end_seconds": 169.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.05,
      "end_seconds": 180.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "It's propranolol, 40 milligrams, twice a day. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 182.01,
      "end_seconds": 190.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier blood pressure 117 over 81, pulse is 66 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 98 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.59,
      "end_seconds": 194.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.08,
      "end_seconds": 201.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Okay, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.84,
      "end_seconds": 204.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.07,
      "end_seconds": 221.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "There are grouped blisters on a red base along one band on the right side and and none cross the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.69,
      "end_seconds": 228.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "you can relax now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.13,
      "end_seconds": 249.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with shingles at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.56,
      "end_seconds": 251.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.11,
      "end_seconds": 261.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's shingles, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.61,
      "end_seconds": 292.48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.87,
      "text": "Keep the rash covered and stay away from pregnant women and newborn babies until it has crusted. Please come and see me in one week. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.42,
      "end_seconds": 299.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "So, I come back in one week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.84,
      "end_seconds": 305.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.98,
      "end_seconds": 308.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.67,
      "end_seconds": 312.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}